{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KzumGHHS579FiPoJaPdr9A","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Díaz Serna Wormald 2007 \"Bounds on the bisection width for random d-regular graphs\" Theoretical Computer Science pdf\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Bounds on the bisection width for random d -regular graphs\",\"url\":\"https://research.monash.edu/en/publications/bounds-on-the-bisection-width-for-random-d-regular-graphs/\"},{\"title\":\"ALCOMFT TR 03 44\",\"url\":\"https://cs.au.dk/~gerth/alcom-ft/TR/ALCOMFT-TR-03-44.html\"},{\"title\":\"ALCOMFT TR 03 44\",\"url\":\"https://users-cs.au.dk/gerth/alcom-ft/TR/ALCOMFT-TR-03-44.html\"},{\"title\":\"2004 | OriginalPaper | Buchkapitel\",\"url\":\"https://www.springerprofessional.de/computation-of-the-bisection-width-for-random-d-regular-graphs/14184060\"},{\"title\":\"Bisection width, max-cut and internal partitions of 5-regular graphs\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2509.08531v1\"},{\"title\":\"ALCOMFT TR 03 43\",\"url\":\"https://www.cs.au.dk/~gerth/alcom-ft/TR/ALCOMFT-TR-03-43.html\"},{\"title\":\"ALCOMFT TR 03 43\",\"url\":\"https://tildeweb.au.dk/au121/alcom-ft/TR/ALCOMFT-TR-03-43.html\"},{\"title\":\"bounds on the max and min bisection of random cubic and random 4\",\"url\":\"https://research.monash.edu/en/publications/bounds-on-the-max-and-min-bisection-of-random-cubic-and-random-4-/\"},{\"title\":\"www.arxiv.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.arxiv.org/pdf/2211.03206\"},{\"title\":\"Treffer: Bounds on the bisection width for random d-regular graphs\",\"url\":\"https://ubmr.hds.hebis.de/EdsRecord/edscal%252Cedscal.19033244\"}]\n\nThe search found the paper's publication record and abstract, but no direct PDF of the 2007 article.\n\n**Publication details:** The Monash University research repository lists the paper as by J. Díaz, M. J. Serna and N. C. Wormald, in *Theoretical Computer Science*, volume 382, issue 2, pages 120–130, published 31 August 2007 (Pages (from-to)120-130 ... Volume382 Issue number2). A library catalogue record gives the same volume and pages and notes that the paper was first presented at LATIN 2004 (Source: Latin American theoretical informatics, Theoretical computer science. 382(2):120-130). A Springer listing confirms the LATIN 2004 version, titled \"Computation of the Bisection Width for Random d-Regular Graphs\" (2004 | OriginalPaper | Buchkapitel).\n\n**Content:** The abstract says the authors give an explicit way to compute asymptotically almost sure upper bounds on the bisection width of random d-regular graphs, for any value of d. The bounds come from analysing a randomized greedy algorithm, and the paper gives bounds for 5 ≤ d ≤ 12. It also yields asymptotic lower bounds for the size of the maximum bisection.\n\n**Free PDF:** The earlier 2003 ALCOM-FT technical report of the same title is hosted at Aarhus University, with a PostScript file (ALCOMFT-TR-03-44.ps.gz (91 kb).). I found no PDF of the published 2007 journal article in these results. The Elsevier page or a university repository would be the place to check for it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d0376bd-2c82-42d0-bb0a-a9a308847d25","uuid":"fc84a411-aef6-4b04-8174-60868b6ec2db","timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:38:23.144Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Díaz Serna Wormald 2007 \"Bounds on the bisection width for random d-regular graphs\" Theoretical Computer Science pdf","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WVciYQW78Yv81BCMGGsupp","content":[{"title":"Bounds on the bisection width for random d -regular graphs","url":"https://research.monash.edu/en/publications/bounds-on-the-bisection-width-for-random-d-regular-graphs/"},{"title":"ALCOMFT TR 03 44","url":"https://cs.au.dk/~gerth/alcom-ft/TR/ALCOMFT-TR-03-44.html"},{"title":"ALCOMFT TR 03 44","url":"https://users-cs.au.dk/gerth/alcom-ft/TR/ALCOMFT-TR-03-44.html"},{"title":"2004 |